# Environment Variables for OG Image Generation

# Site URL - Used for generating absolute URLs in metadata
# This is OPTIONAL - Vercel automatically detects the correct URL
# Only set this if you need to override the automatic detection
#
# Development: Automatically uses http://localhost:3000
# Vercel Preview: Automatically uses https://your-app-git-branch.vercel.app
# Vercel Production: Automatically uses https://your-domain.com (or Vercel URL)
#
# Manual override (optional):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-custom-domain.com
